  "analysis_conventions": [
    "Warm comparison uses recorded median of five measured calls in independent processes. These are not paired measurements and have no confidence-interval claim.",
    "Stage fractions and Amdahl limits use one actual Metal call closest to that median, summing serial per-scale handle metrics within that call; independent medians are never added.",
    "wait_ms contains GPU command duration. residual_wait=wait_ms-device_ms includes submission, scheduling, synchronization and wakeup; it is not measured CPU busy time.",
    "upload_ms is CPU memcpy into Apple shared buffers, not PCIe transfer. device_ms includes GPU memory/stalls and is not ALU-only time or utilization.",
    "Retained GPU/source/template/stat buffers exclude driver allocations and CPU images/pyramid. RSS overlaps shared-buffer memory; never add RSS to GPU bytes.",
    "Top-NCC zero-cost speed limit assumes all other stages fixed: speedup <= T/(T-NCC). It is an inference for this measured GPU variant, not a bound on moving other CPU stages."
  ],
